      <div style="font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;color:#61667C;line-height:1.6;">InstaPay and PESONet, same flat rate every time, however many bills you pay.</div>
